{"schema":"LAW_EN_DOCUMENT_V1","id":"i18n-893b6ac76684a44773111812adcd24ba585e8945ebb3625d","family_id":"KR:006574","country":"KR","language":"en","title":"Enforcement Rules of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act","title_original":"교통ㆍ에너지ㆍ환경세법 시행규칙","kind":"기획재정부령","source_version":"270243","promulgated":null,"effective":null,"translation_status":"AI_DRAFT","body_status":"BODY_LOADED","source_url":"https://www.law.go.kr/LSW/lsInfoP.do?lsiSeq=270243","source_sha256":"99129fa87198dde7d65113cb7db1fbce6f402e0eebdd4849d79cfbe3f5e1d12e","body_sha256":"f49781d0bf3af3b722fe6b780bee4802aada4ab9b6fa79803b8fb97d78db3563","article_count":0,"full_text":"[Attached Form No. 11] <Amended on April 5, 2007>\n\n(Front)\n\nTraffic, Energy and Environment Tax — Certification of Destruction or Loss of Released Articles\n[ ] Without payment of tax  [ ] Tax-exempt\n[ ] Application for Certification  [ ] Certificate\n\nProcessing period: 5 days.\n\nApplicant\n\n| ① Name (representative) | ② Resident (corporate) registration number |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ③ Business name (corporate name) | ④ Telephone number |\n| | |\n| ⑤ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n| ⑥ Location of manufacturing place | ⑦ Business registration number |\n| | |\n\n| ⑧ Name of approving tax office | ____________________ Tax Office | | |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ⑨ Date of approval | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ | ⑩ Approval number | No. ______ |\n\nDetails of Application\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>⑪ Name of article</th><th>⑫ Quantity</th><th>⑬ Specifications</th><th>⑭ Unit price</th><th>⑮ Price</th><th>⑯ Tax rate</th><th>⑰ Tax amount</th></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</table>\n\nReleasing Party\n\n| ⑱ Name (representative) | ⑲ Business name (corporate name) |\n|---|---|\n| | |\n| ⑳ Address (location of head office) | |\n| | |\n\n| ㉑ Date of destruction or loss | Year ____ Month ____ Day ____ |\n|---|---|\n| ㉒ Cause of destruction or loss | |\n| ㉓ Method of handling the destroyed or lost articles | |\n| ㉔ Matters for reference | |\n\nPlease certify pursuant to Article 18 (2) of the Enforcement Decree of the Traffic, Energy and Environment Tax Act that the articles were destroyed or lost as stated above.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nApplicant: ____________________ (Signature or seal)\n\nTo the Head of the Tax Office\n\nNo. ______\n\nI certify that the facts stated above are correct.\n\nYear ____ Month ____ Day ____\nHead of the Tax Office: ____________________ [Seal]\n\nTo: ____________________\n\nRequired documents: None.\n※ This application form is distributed free of charge.\nFee: None.\n\nGeneral paper, 60 g/m² (recycled), or newsprint, 54 g/m² (recycled)\n\n(Reverse)\n\nThis application is processed as follows.\n\n<table>\n<tr><th>Applicant</th><th>Processing authority: Head of the tax office having jurisdiction over the place of business</th></tr>\n<tr><td>1. Prepare application</td><td>2. Receive application (Civil Service Office)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>3. Investigate and verify (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>4. Decide (Final decision delegated to the department head)</td></tr>\n<tr><td></td><td>5. Prepare certificate (Department in charge)</td></tr>\n</table>\n\nThe application proceeds from box 1 to box 2 on the right, then downward through boxes 3, 4, and 5. The final arrow from box 5 runs left and upward to the applicant and is labelled “Issue certificate.”\n","metadata":{"author_method":"Exact held-source units translated or completed using explicitly recorded source/target spans; original official records remain unchanged. All new units are MACHINE_TRANSLATION and UNREVIEWED.","author_source_review_evidence":[{"evidence":{"exact_author_input":{"path":"D:\\lawsofkorea\\projece\\07_법률번역\\06_법령별다국어완성\\LAW12_20261018_1442\\workc_1129_2094\\review_pending\\WORKC_G01_P04\\1526_KR000623\\translations\\author_inputs\\a